{"id":"n66159-1-9","stage":5,"title":"심야 · 深夜","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66159-1-9-1","ko":"어제 새벽 두 시쯤에 잠이 안 와서 산책을 했어.","zh":"昨天凌晨两点左右睡不着，就出去散步了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日。","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}},{"text":"새벽","meaning":"凌晨，早晨","explanation":"새벽：凌晨，早晨。","readings":[{"term":"새벽","audio":"/audio/d0a36389c6b198a158ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62740","senseId":"2","lemma":"새벽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"새벽","audio":"/audio/d0a36389c6b198a158ee.mp3"}},{"text":"두","meaning":"两","explanation":"두：两。","readings":[{"term":"두","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71458","senseId":"1","lemma":"두","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"두","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3"}},{"text":"시쯤에","meaning":"点，点钟","explanation":"시：点，点钟；쯤：名词后缀，构成派生名词；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"시","audio":"/audio/bfa42cf6a12e91233038.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65108","senseId":"1","lemma":"시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시쯤에","audio":"/audio/adcbfc9a9bfbd8b096c6.mp3"}},{"text":"잠이","meaning":"觉，睡眠","explanation":"잠：觉，睡眠；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"잠","audio":"/audio/699e97260979403d2584.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70078","senseId":"1","lemma":"잠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잠이","audio":"/audio/17d08bab4f403526dabd.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"와서","meaning":"来","explanation":"오다：来；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"와서","audio":"/audio/fff1948ffcab0f48d739.mp3"}},{"text":"산책을","meaning":"散步","explanation":"산책：散步；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"산책","audio":"/audio/b745d43721954853192d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62506","senseId":"1","lemma":"산책","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"산책을","audio":"/audio/b7923bb9f67972e5c5c1.mp3"}},{"text":"했어.","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"했어","audio":"/audio/76f3569b074c48dd5200.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"d0a36389c6b198a1","term":"새벽","zh":"凌晨，早晨","audio":"/audio/d0a36389c6b198a158ee.mp3","entryId":"62740","definition":"很早的上午时间。","pronunciation":["새벽"]},{"id":"dfedd225bb659d50","term":"두","zh":"两","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3","entryId":"71458","definition":"两个的。","pronunciation":["두ː"]},{"id":"bfa42cf6a12e9123","term":"시","zh":"点，点钟","audio":"/audio/bfa42cf6a12e91233038.mp3","entryId":"65108","definition":"计时单位，表示一天二十四小时中的某一个。","pronunciation":["시"]},{"id":"699e97260979403d","term":"잠","zh":"觉，睡眠","audio":"/audio/699e97260979403d2584.mp3","entryId":"70078","definition":"指闭上眼睛，停止身体、精神活动而休息一会儿的状态。","pronunciation":["잠"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"6fe