15fac71e2.mp3"}},{"text":"않았어?","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71581","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"않았어","audio":"/audio/5a7720bef7cd2ac4fcc3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d14f5bfb24390ed9","term":"그런","zh":"那种，那样","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3","entryId":"60341","definition":"状态、模样、性质等那个样子的。","pronunciation":["그런"]},{"id":"2f4ed0d07aafc359","term":"심야","zh":"深夜","audio":"/audio/2f4ed0d07aafc359bd57.mp3","entryId":"66159","definition":"夜里非常晚的时候。","pronunciation":["시ː먀"]},{"id":"c55ed96b19a1f2f2","term":"산책하다","zh":"散步","audio":"/audio/c55ed96b19a1f2f29ce7.mp3","entryId":"61811","definition":"稍作休息或为了健康而在附近慢走。","pronunciation":["산ː채카다"]},{"id":"6c5692ebced898c0","term":"무섭다","zh":"怕，害怕，可怕，恐惧","audio":"/audio/6c5692ebced898c0376c.mp3","entryId":"55637","definition":"忌讳某个对象或担心出什么事。","pronunciation":["무섭따"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71581","definition":"用于否定前文所指的行为。","pronunciation":["안타"]}],"audio":"/audio/07d4cbaacbb09b12b972.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.391,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=66159","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":162,"sequenceScore":3.2177,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["大半夜的还去散步？不怕吗？","昨天凌晨两点左右睡不着，就出去散步了。","敏俊在很多方面都很有天赋呢。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["昨天凌晨两点左右睡不着，就出去散步了。","敏俊在很多方面都很有天赋呢。","大半夜的还去散步？不怕吗？"],"answer":2}]}
